{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31745","headline":"携新文诣张籍韩愈途中成 · 贾岛","name":"携新文诣张籍韩愈途中成","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"袖有新成诗，欲见张韩老。\n青竹未生翼，一步万里道。\n仰望青冥天，云雪压我脑。\n失却终南山，惆怅满怀抱。\n安得西北风，身愿变蓬草。\n地只闻此语，突出惊我倒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}